  "description": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; <strong>Our Brand</strong>: Tiffany York is a retailer of fine jewelry and gem collections that&nbsp; showcase the most beautiful pieces of jewelry.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; <strong>Our Products</strong>: Our collections consist of highly sought after and uncommon men and women's jewelry. We inventory hundreds of beautiful pieces ranging in price from a couple of hundred dollars to well over $40K.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; <strong>Our USP</strong> (Unique Selling Point): Our generous affiliate program offers <strong>5%</strong> on sales with an aweseom 365 day cookie allowance, giving our affiliates sufficient time to build long lasting income streams on merchandise that are high-ticket in price. As you well know, jewels and gems are some of the most costly resources you can buy. Now, you can share in the massive claims on every sale through your affiliate account.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The Majority of our inventory are high ticket imported fine jewelry pieces. Although, 10% may at first appear less than other programs that may be offering higher rates - Keep in mind that a 20% commission on an inexpensive items may&nbsp; hardly be worth your effort. In contrast, our inventory is at much higher selling price. Our 10% commission equates to massive earnings.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We also extend extra tier commissions and may offer MLM options in the future and include lifetime payouts for our dedicated and motivated affilates. Come and grow with us.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull; <strong>Our Payment terms</strong>: We offer monthly payout and special in house incentives. Payments are released to your preferred method of payment (default method is PayPal or bank check).</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull; <strong>Growing Inventory</strong>: Means more opportunities for sales. New items are addedd weekly as our inventory continues to grow and expand into other complimentary consumer categories.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Y<strong>our customer's will not be dissapointed in what they find at Tiffany York</strong>.&nbsp;<em>We do not sell costume jewelry, imitation metals, cubic zirconia or any other type of jewelry except fine jewelry. We only merchandise heirloom worthy pieces worthy of future generations of family .</em></span></p>",
